            "review_title": "Review at Luvi Vegan restaurant",
            "review_text": "Happiness52952739082\n1 contribution\n0\nA diverse menu that meets all preferences.\nAug 2026 • Friends\nMy group of friends is quite special because some people like seafood, some people like eating meat, some vegetarians, some dieters and have small children. Therefore, finding a restaurant that meets everyone is always a challenge. Shanghai Restaurant has solved this problem outstandingly. The menu is diverse with a wide range of choices from fresh seafood to turtles and fries such as American fried corn, fried potatoes and fried seafood mushrooms – perfectly suited for vegetarians or small children. Dieters can choose light dishes such as salad or garlic. No one in the team has to choose hard. Careful service, inquiries and dedicated advice. This is a rare restaurant that truly serves every guest in a complete way.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten August 3, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
