            "review_title": "Review at Luvi Vegan restaurant",
            "review_text": "Richard B\nBristol, United Kingdom360 contributions\n0\nOK Food At A Sound Price\nFeb 2018 • Friends\nConveniently just five minutes walk from the apartment I rented for a few days. Visited with a friend who publishes a lifestyle magazine. I enjoyed the crunchiness of the Spring Rolls I ordered though throughout my travels I had eaten better. My main dish of vegetables and rice was a bit bland and lacked seasoning - some ginger or garlic wold have lifted the dish. My friend liked his soup but agreed the spring rolls were not the best.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 3, 2018",
