            "review_title": "Review at Luvi Vegan restaurant",
            "review_text": "Rinnia\nSydney212 contributions\n0\nHappy accident!\nJan 2018 • Friends\nA taxi driver wrongly took us to this strip of shops while we were looking for another vegetarian restaurant. We decided to just try Luvi instead of looking any further. We were a group of 1 vegetarian and 4 meat eaters. The vegetarian had one of the best vegetarian meals during our Vietnam trip. The rest of us also had great meals. The food was different to the usual fare we had been eating but still identifiably Vietnamese. All excellent.\nCommunication in English is a little difficult but with a little effort and a picture menu is manageable.\n\nWell worth a stop if you are in this part of town.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 11, 2018",
