            "review_title": "Review at Luvi Vegan restaurant",
            "review_text": "Paul M\nTexas Gulf Coast, Texas14 contributions\n0\nFood was very good and priced right\nJan 2018 • Couples\nWe were walking down a street and saw a Vegan restaurant, first one I've seen. Went in to look and decided to stay. Menu with English subtitles. Staff English not so good but we were able make it work. Food was amazing, very tasty, great flavor, presentation was very good. Staff was friendly and easy to work with. One of the managers tried to teach us some Vietnamese. Best price for the food I've had in my 22 days in Saigon so far.Excellent Wifi, good music and at a volume you can have a normal conversation.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 7, 2018",
